# Cookwala Core 0.2 ROS 2 action: run one recipe node on one device (used by a hub that
# splits a recipe across robots and appliances; see Open-RMF for fleet-level dispatch).

# ---- Goal
string node_json           # the recipe Node (recipe.schema.json#/$defs/Node)
string envelope_json       # the op envelope from vocab/ops.json, resolved by the hub
string target_json         # narrower recipe target inside the envelope, or empty
---
# ---- Result
bool envelope_ok           # medium stayed inside envelope (and target, once reached)
string verified_by         # sensor | model | time | human
string summary_json        # ExecutionLog step summary (min/max/end per sensor)
string deviation_json      # ExecutionLog step deviation, or empty
---
# ---- Feedback
float32 progress
float32 medium_temp_c
bool target_reached
